<title>HONG KONG: TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>$328,000 Hong Kong Open men's tennis tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-David Prinosil (Germany) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 3-4</p>
<p>(Raoux retired injured)</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) leads Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-4 4-6 2-1</p>
<p>(play suspended because of rain, resumes Friday)</p>
<p>Carsten Arriens (Germany) leads 5-Patrick Rafter (Australia)</p>
<p>6-4 6-7 (4-7) 2-1 (play suspended because, resumes Friday)</p>
</text>
